Object_id
----------

primary like in sql 

6ab2a7c187b6dd4a18e53563

12 byte == 24 char

4 byte - time stamp

5 byte -> 3 - machin (host info )  
    2 - process id
   
3 byte - random increamental value.   256*256*256


--------------------------
Comparison Query Operator  
--------------------------  
$eq     = 
$ne     !=
$gt     >
$gte    >=
$lt     <
$lte    <=

$in, $nin

Syntax
------
db.collection.find({field: {$eq:value
  }
})

db.stud.find({fees: {$eq: 30000
  }
})

db.stud.find({fees: 30000
})

db.stud.find({fees: {$gte: 30000
  }
})

db.stud.find({fees: {$lte: 40000
  }
}).count()


