--------------------------
  Logical Query Operator  
--------------------------  

Syntax 
------

db.collection.find({<Log-Op>: [
    {expression_1
    },
    {expression_2
    },
    {expression_3
    },...,
    {expression_n
    }
  ]
})


db.collection.find({$or: [
    {expression_1
    },
    {expression_2
    },
    {expression_3
    },...,
    {expression_n
    }
  ]
})

$or $and $not 

or - performs logical OR on array of two or more
atleast one of the expression(confition)


Qury ) no_of_reviews > 3 or tags include 'programming'

db.books.find({$or: [
    {no_of_reviews: {$gt: 3
      }
    },
    {tags: "programming"
    }
  ]
})

db.books.find({$or: [
    {no_of_reviews: {$gt: 3
      }
    },
    {tags: "programming"
    }
  ]
}).count()

Q) select all doc where either no_of_reviews is less than 3 
or downloadble true or profile contains atleast 3 books

db.books.find({
  "author.profile.exp": {$gt: 3
  }
})

db.boos.find({$or: [
    {no_of_reviews: {$lt: 3
      }
    },
    {downloadable: true
    },
    {
      "author.profile.exp": {$gte: 3
      }
    }
  ]
})

db.books.find({$or: [
    {no_of_reviews: {$lt: 3
      }
    },
    {downloadable: true
    },
    {
      "author.profile.books": {$gt: 3
      }
    }
  ]
})

db.books.find({$and: [
    {no_of_reviews: {$lt: 3
      }
    },
    {downloadble: "true"
    },
    {
      "author.profile.books": {$gte: 3
      }
    }
  ]
})


db.books.find({$and: [
    {no_of_reviews: {$gt: 3
      }
    },
    {tags: "programming"
    }
  ]
}).count()

db.books.find({$nor: [
    {no_of_reviews: {$gt: 3
      }
    },
    {tags: "programming"
    }
  ]
}).count()

