Datatype in  mongodb 
---------------------------

BSON Type       Numeric           Alias 
---------------------------------------
Double          1               double
String          2               string
Object          3               object
Array           4               array
BinaryData      5               binData
Object_id       7               objectId
Boolean         8               bool
Date            9               date
Null            10              null
32 bit          16              NumberInt
64 bit          18              NumberLong
Deciamal128     19              decimal  


