slice
-------

db.collection.find({query
  },
  {<array>: {$slice:n
    }
  })
n->
from  first to positive n
from last to negitive n
if n is > count return all value

db.collection.find({query
  },
  {<array>: {$slice: [n1,n2
      ]
    }
  })
n1 - numner to skip
n2 - number to return


